{"seq":1,"slug":"memo-and-callback","title":"memo 与 useCallback","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/memo-and-callback","wordCount":700,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"memo-与-usecallback\">memo 与 useCallback</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>React 中父组件重渲染时，子组件默认也会重渲染，即使 props 没有变化，复杂组件树因此产生大量无用计算。<code>React.memo</code>、<code>useMemo</code>、<code>useCallback</code> 是 React 提供的三种记忆化工具，它们都以引用相等（Referential Equality）为前提：只有 props 或依赖的引用稳定，缓存才会命中。本章讲解重渲染的代价、<code>React.memo</code> 与自定义比较函数、<code>useCallback</code> / <code>useMemo</code> 的用法，以及何时不应使用 memoization。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重渲染的代价\">重渲染的代价</h2><p>React 中父组件重渲染时，其所有子组件默认都会重渲染，即使 props 没有变化。对于复杂组件树，这会造成大量不必要的计算。<code>React.memo</code>、<code>useMemo</code> 和 <code>useCallback</code> 是 React 提供的三种记忆化工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Parent 重渲染&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;Child A 重渲染 ❌不必要&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Child B 重渲染 ✅props 变了&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Child C 重渲染 ❌不必要&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Grandchild 重渲染 ❌不必要&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Parent 重渲染\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"Child A 重渲染 ❌不必要\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Child B 重渲染 ✅props 变了\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Child C 重渲染 ❌不必要\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Grandchild 重渲染 ❌不必要\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-memo\">React.memo</h2><p><code>React.memo</code> 是一个高阶组件，它对 props 进行<strong>浅比较</strong>。如果 props 没有变化，则跳过重渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface ExpensiveListProps {&#10;  items: string[];&#10;  onItemClick: (item: string) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ExpensiveList = memo(function ExpensiveList({ items, onItemClick }: ExpensiveListProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {items.map((item) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={item} onClick={() =&gt; onItemClick(item)}&gt;&#10;          {item}&#10;        &lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface ExpensiveListProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: string[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onItemClick: (item: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ExpensiveList = memo(function ExpensiveList({ items, onItemClick }: ExpensiveListProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {items.map((item) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;li key={item} onClick={() => onItemClick(item)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {item}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义比较函数\">自定义比较函数</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const UserCard = memo(&#10;  function UserCard({ user }: { user: User }) {&#10;    return (&#10;      &lt;div&gt;&#10;        &lt;h3&gt;{user.name}&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;{user.email}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    );&#10;  },&#10;  (prevProps, nextProps) =&gt; {&#10;    return prevProps.user.id === nextProps.user.id &amp;&amp; prevProps.user.name === nextProps.user.name;&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const UserCard = memo(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function UserCard({ user }: { user: User }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;h3>{user.name}&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>{user.email}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (prevProps, nextProps) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return prevProps.user.id === nextProps.user.id &#x26;&#x26; prevProps.user.name === nextProps.user.name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认浅比较</td>\n<td><code>Object.is</code> 逐个比较 props</td>\n<td>大多数情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义比较</td>\n<td>第二个参数传入比较函数</td>\n<td>复杂对象 props</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"referential-equality-引用相等\">Referential Equality 引用相等</h2><p><code>React.memo</code> 使用 <code>Object.is</code> 比较 props。问题在于每次父组件渲染时创建的新对象和新函数都不等于旧的：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Parent() {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);&#10;&#10;  const config = { theme: &#39;dark&#39;, size: &#39;large&#39; };&#10;  const handleClick = () =&gt; console.log(&#39;clicked&#39;);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1)}&gt;Count: {count}&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;MemoChild config={config} onClick={handleClick} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Parent() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const config = { theme: 'dark', size: 'large' };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleClick = () => console.log('clicked');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => setCount((c) => c + 1)}>Count: {count}&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;MemoChild config={config} onClick={handleClick} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每次 <code>Parent</code> 渲染，<code>config</code> 和 <code>handleClick</code> 都是新引用，<code>MemoChild</code> 的 memo 失效。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"usecallback\">useCallback</h2><p><code>useCallback</code> 缓存函数引用，只在依赖变化时创建新函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Parent() {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const handleSearch = useCallback((term: string) =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(`Searching for: ${term}`);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  const handleItemSelect = useCallback(&#10;    (id: string) =&gt; {&#10;      console.log(`Selected item ${id}, count is ${count}`);&#10;    },&#10;    [count],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={query} onChange={(e) =&gt; setQuery(e.target.value)} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1)}&gt;+1&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;SearchResults onSearch={handleSearch} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;ItemList onSelect={handleItemSelect} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;const SearchResults = memo(function SearchResults({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (term: string) =&gt; void }) {&#10;  return &lt;div onClick={() =&gt; onSearch(&#39;test&#39;)}&gt;搜索结果&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Parent() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [query, setQuery] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleSearch = useCallback((term: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console.log(`Searching for: ${term}`);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleItemSelect = useCallback(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (id: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      console.log(`Selected item ${id}, count is ${count}`);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [count],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input value={query} onChange={(e) => setQuery(e.target.value)} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => setCount((c) => c + 1)}>+1&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;SearchResults onSearch={handleSearch} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ItemList onSelect={handleItemSelect} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const SearchResults = memo(function SearchResults({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (term: string) => void }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div onClick={() => onSearch('test')}>搜索结果&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Parent 渲染&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B{&quot;useCallback 依赖变了?&quot;}&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; C[&quot;返回缓存的函数引用&quot;]&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; D[&quot;创建新函数并缓存&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;传给 memo 子组件&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;props 引用相同?&quot;}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[&quot;跳过子组件渲染 ✅&quot;]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; H[&quot;子组件重渲染&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Parent 渲染\"]\n    A --&gt; B{\"useCallback 依赖变了?\"}\n    B -- 否 --&gt; C[\"返回缓存的函数引用\"]\n    B -- 是 --&gt; D[\"创建新函数并缓存\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"传给 memo 子组件\"]\n    E --&gt; F{\"props 引用相同?\"}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[\"跳过子组件渲染 ✅\"]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; H[\"子组件重渲染\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"usememo\">useMemo</h2><p><code>useMemo</code> 缓存计算结果，只在依赖变化时重新计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function ProductPage({ products, filter }: { products: Product[]; filter: string }) {&#10;  const filteredProducts = useMemo(&#10;    () =&gt; products.filter((p) =&gt; p.name.toLowerCase().includes(filter.toLowerCase())),&#10;    [products, filter],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  const stats = useMemo(&#10;    () =&gt; ({&#10;      total: filteredProducts.length,&#10;      avgPrice: filteredProducts.reduce((sum, p) =&gt; sum + p.price, 0) / filteredProducts.length,&#10;    }),&#10;    [filteredProducts],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  const config = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ theme: &#39;dark&#39;, size: &#39;large&#39; }), []);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;StatsBar stats={stats} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;MemoizedProductList items={filteredProducts} config={config} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function ProductPage({ products, filter }: { products: Product[]; filter: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const filteredProducts = useMemo(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => products.filter((p) => p.name.toLowerCase().includes(filter.toLowerCase())),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [products, filter],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const stats = useMemo(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      total: filteredProducts.length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      avgPrice: filteredProducts.reduce((sum, p) => sum + p.price, 0) / filteredProducts.length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [filteredProducts],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const config = useMemo(() => ({ theme: 'dark', size: 'large' }), []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;StatsBar stats={stats} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;MemoizedProductList items={filteredProducts} config={config} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook</th>\n<th>缓存内容</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>useCallback</code></td>\n<td>函数引用</td>\n<td>传给 memo 子组件的回调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useMemo</code></td>\n<td>计算结果</td>\n<td>昂贵计算、对象/数组引用稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"何时不应使用-memoization\">何时不应使用 Memoization</h2><p>记忆化不是免费的——它消耗内存存储缓存值，并且每次渲染都需要比较依赖。<strong>过度使用反而降低性能</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否需要 memo</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>子组件渲染很轻量</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>memo 比较的开销 &gt; 重渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>props 每次都变</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>memo 永远失效，白白比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件无子组件</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>影响范围小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>昂贵计算</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>避免重复计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传递给 memo 子组件的对象/函数</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>保持引用稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型列表的 item 组件</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>避免全部重渲染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function SimpleLabel({ text }: { text: string }) {&#10;  return &lt;span&gt;{text}&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 不需要 memo：非常轻量的组件&#10;const MemoLabel = memo(SimpleLabel);&#10;&#10;// ❌ 不需要 useCallback：没有传给 memo 子组件&#10;function Form() {&#10;  const handleSubmit = useCallback(() =&gt; {&#10;    submitForm();&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;form onSubmit={handleSubmit}&gt;...&lt;/form&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function SimpleLabel({ text }: { text: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;span>{text}&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 不需要 memo：非常轻量的组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const MemoLabel = memo(SimpleLabel);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 不需要 useCallback：没有传给 memo 子组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Form() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleSubmit = useCallback(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    submitForm();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>...&#x3C;/form>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> React 编译器（React Compiler）正在开发中，目标是自动为组件添加 memoization，让开发者无需手动管理。在编译器普及前，手动 memo 仍是优化大型组件树的重要手段。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function OptimizedApp() {&#10;  const [searchTerm, setSearchTerm] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState&lt;string | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;  const handleSelect = useCallback((id: string) =&gt; {&#10;    setSelectedId(id);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  const handleSearch = useCallback((term: string) =&gt; {&#10;    setSearchTerm(term);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;SearchBar onSearch={handleSearch} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;Spinner /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;ResultList searchTerm={searchTerm} onSelect={handleSelect} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      {selectedId &amp;&amp; &lt;DetailPanel id={selectedId} /&gt;}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;const SearchBar = memo(function SearchBar({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (term: string) =&gt; void }) {&#10;  const [input, setInput] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;input&#10;      value={input}&#10;      onChange={(e) =&gt; {&#10;        setInput(e.target.value);&#10;        onSearch(e.target.value);&#10;      }}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function OptimizedApp() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [searchTerm, setSearchTerm] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState&#x3C;string | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleSelect = useCallback((id: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setSelectedId(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleSearch = useCallback((term: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setSearchTerm(term);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;SearchBar onSearch={handleSearch} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;Spinner />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;ResultList searchTerm={searchTerm} onSelect={handleSelect} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {selectedId &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;DetailPanel id={selectedId} />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const SearchBar = memo(function SearchBar({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (term: string) => void }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [input, setInput] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      value={input}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onChange={(e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setInput(e.target.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onSearch(e.target.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>React.memo</code> 对 props 浅比较，相同则跳过重渲染</li>\n<li><code>useCallback</code> 缓存函数引用，确保传给 memo 子组件的回调引用稳定</li>\n<li><code>useMemo</code> 缓存计算结果和对象引用，避免重复计算和引用失效</li>\n<li><strong>不要过度 memo</strong>：轻量组件、props 总变的场景不需要 memoization</li>\n<li>React Compiler 将来会自动处理 memoization，但当前手动优化仍有必要</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"memo 与 useCallback","id":"memo-与-usecallback"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"重渲染的代价","id":"重渲染的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"React.memo","id":"react-memo"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义比较函数","id":"自定义比较函数"},{"level":2,"text":"Referential Equality 引用相等","id":"referential-equality-引用相等"},{"level":2,"text":"useCallback","id":"usecallback"},{"level":2,"text":"useMemo","id":"usememo"},{"level":2,"text":"何时不应使用 Memoization","id":"何时不应使用-memoization"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流式渲染与 Suspense","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/streaming-and-suspense"},"next":{"title":"虚拟列表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/virtual-list"}}